				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Wind): Sync commit.json with latest refactor message\n\nUpdate commit.json to reflect the actual message of the most recent commit (e71ed57b) — Prune orphaned imports and error helpers from de-Effectified services.\n\nThe file had fallen out of sync, still carrying the message from the prior f97e5ddf commit (Strip Effect monad from Commands service).",
			"SHA": "f7c9aff429e42ea83dfcfa8d6154d944334f565d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T21:59:11Z",
